{"version":1,"content":"<p>中午12時許，石鼓洲旁人工島綜合廢物管理設施第一期發生火警，消防動用兩條喉及兩隊煙帽隊灌救。</p><p>火警於下午1時24分升為三級。</p><p>約930人疏散，坐船離開石鼓洲，其間一名60歲姓張男子不適，由政府飛行服務隊直升機吊起，送往東區醫院治理。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:41:28.710432+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:43:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:10.162794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:10.162794+00:00","content_hash":"5f924d17ca2bacb1af490ac6d3c52b9150303ce017f46ebdf58adfa119096db9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}